# Frontend Angular Rules

## Stack

- Angular 19 standalone components (no NgModules)
- Tailwind CSS 3.4 — use `Theme` from `constants/theme.constants.ts`
- `@angular/animations` for enter/leave transitions where needed
- RxJS via `PortfolioDataService` — single source for API data

## Component patterns

- Inline templates OK for small components; keep under ~120 lines or split
- Use `@Input()` for data from parent; no duplicate HTTP calls in child components
- Images: `loading="lazy"` except hero photo (`loading="eager"`)
- Links: external use `target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"`

## Styling

- Design: premium dark — `bg-slate-950`, glass cards (`backdrop-blur`, `border-white/10`)
- Accent: indigo/violet gradients; avoid pure black-on-black
- Section padding: `py-20 md:py-28`; max width `max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8`
- Section headings: `text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight`

## Do not

- Remove or bypass `PortfolioDataService`
- Change `environment.prod.ts` apiUrl without explicit request
- Add heavy dependencies without justification
